# ── Dev Portal evidence packages (force-tracked) ─────────────────────────────
# The broad rules above (*.md line 19, screenshots/ traces/ *.png *.zip) would
# otherwise drop the whole evidence bundle. Re-include it here (last match wins).
# Tracked: all .md reports, raw/*.json captures, and screenshot .png files.
# NOT tracked: Playwright trace .zip files — they are large binaries; keep them
# in /test-results/ or move to git-lfs, then add `!artifacts/**/*.zip` if needed.
!artifacts/
!artifacts/dev-portal-evidence-*/
!artifacts/dev-portal-evidence-*/**/
!artifacts/dev-portal-evidence-*/screenshots/
!artifacts/dev-portal-evidence-*/traces/
!artifacts/dev-portal-evidence-*/**/*.md
!artifacts/dev-portal-evidence-*/**/*.json
!artifacts/dev-portal-evidence-*/**/*.png
